Z||000000||TwisT||01-28-2001||05:01 PM||||After reading up on an old post regarding Eddy Snaauw's Fiero interior,  I understand that the molds had been sold to Scott Tilden.  He was working on getting a patent for the kit and preparing for offering the kits to the public.  Here is the related thread:<P> <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/003193.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/003193.html</A><BR> <P>Anyone know if these kits are available yet?  If not,  I would like to get ahold of Scott for info.<P>Thanks gang!<P>Brett<BR>  <P><p>[This message has been edited by TwisT (edited 01-28-2001).]||||reg||1
