Z||000006||william_thorniii||01-29-2001||12:30 PM||||Mr. Tilden has intentions of manufacturing some kits.  He has given me reason to doubt his competency though.  Eddy has assured me that if Mr. Tilden does not produce a product in the future, he will sell an additional set of molds to another individual that will manufacture and sell them.  <P>William T. Thorn, III||||reg||13
Z||000007||TwisT||01-29-2001||05:26 PM||||Good to hear William...  it would be a shame to see such a well orchastrated and attractive Fiero interior go by the wasteside.  It is,  by far,  the best I've seen.  There are a few kits out there now that,  in my opinion,  don't even come close.<P>Keep us informed about the interior kit...  I know that I'm not the only one who is very interested in purchasing.<P>Thanks again,<P>Brett<P>'88 "Italfiero"  GT  ||||reg||1
